\pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Doing Hawaii + RootRecord Partnership Opportunity Brief\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Prepared for Doing Hawaii\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Prepared by RootRecord\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 May 2026\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Purpose\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This brief outlines a possible partnership between Doing Hawaii and RootRecord. It is intended as a conversation starter, not a final contract or commitment.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii has a strong creator foundation: original Hawaii Island content, a long-running public presence, Kilauea relevance, an existing audience, and a personal story connected to the 2018 eruption. RootRecord has app infrastructure, Android and web product experience, cloud APIs, media-gallery patterns, user account systems, and Kilauea-focused product work through Kilauea Alerts.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The opportunity is to explore whether Doing Hawaii content and RootRecord technology can support each other in a way that keeps Doing Hawaii's creator identity intact while giving the audience a cleaner, more useful digital experience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Executive Summary\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii and RootRecord appear to have a natural audience overlap around Hawaii Island, Kilauea, local storytelling, visual media, and people who want timely or meaningful Hawaii-related content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii brings creator trust, original media, history, and community interest. RootRecord brings app development, account infrastructure, alerting tools, media presentation, and a growing Kilauea-focused product surface.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 A strong partnership would not need to begin as a large project. It could start with a simple, low-risk pilot:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Feature Doing Hawaii as a local creator/media partner.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Organize selected public content into a polished mobile-friendly experience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Explore Kilauea Alerts placements for creator media, clearly separated from official emergency or safety information.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Build toward optional supporter features, content galleries, sponsorships, or custom app experiences if the pilot works well.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The key principle: Doing Hawaii remains the creator brand. RootRecord provides technical support, product structure, and distribution options.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Why Doing Hawaii Stands Out\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii already has several ingredients that are hard to manufacture:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A clear Hawaii Island focus.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A personal creator story.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Public video and visual content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A history connected to the 2018 Kilauea eruption.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A supporter/donation concept already introduced to the audience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Existing social links and a content hub direction.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A recognizable brand presence through channel art, profile imagery, and public pages.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The strongest point is authenticity. Doing Hawaii is not just a generic travel or content page. The public story connects the creator to real Hawaii Island experience and to a moment when many people were looking for eruption-related updates, videos, and perspective.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 That kind of creator connection can complement RootRecord's more structured app and alerting work.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Audience Fit\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii's likely audience includes:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Hawaii Island residents.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Hawaii visitors and trip planners.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Kilauea and volcano watchers.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab People who followed the 2018 eruption.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab YouTube and social media viewers.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Supporters interested in creator-led local content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab People looking for Hawaii photos, videos, wallpapers, and community media.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts users are likely to include some of the same groups. RootRecord's Kilauea Alerts product focuses on official-source conditions, weather, earthquakes, alerts, live feeds, and AI-assisted summaries.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii can add a different layer: local creator perspective, visual storytelling, and community connection.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Those two lanes should stay clearly separated:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab RootRecord/Kilauea Alerts: official-source conditions, alerts, weather, earthquakes, and safety-adjacent information.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Doing Hawaii: creator media, local perspective, photos, videos, history, and community content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 That separation protects both brands and gives users a clearer experience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Partnership Ideas\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 1. Creator Media Placement\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord could feature selected Doing Hawaii public content inside a dedicated creator/media area. This could include:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Featured videos.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Photo highlights.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Wallpaper collections.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Kilauea-related creator content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Links back to Doing Hawaii's main channels.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This would give Doing Hawaii another distribution path while giving RootRecord users richer local content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 2. Kilauea Alerts Content Companion\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii content could appear as a companion layer near Kilauea Alerts features, clearly labeled as creator media rather than official guidance.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Examples:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "Local creator perspective" section.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "Featured Hawaii Island media" cards.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab "From Doing Hawaii" links.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Historical 2018 eruption media references, if approved and properly framed.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 3. Modern Content Hub\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord could help shape a cleaner content hub for Doing Hawaii's existing categories:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Videos.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Photo albums.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Wallpapers.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Supporter content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Games or light interactive features.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Shop or sponsor links.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This could start as a simple landing page or become a larger web/app experience over time.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 4. Supporter and Sponsorship Path\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 If Doing Hawaii wants to rebuild or clarify a supporter model, RootRecord could help structure the experience around:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Free public previews.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Support/donation calls to action.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Optional supporter-only content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsor placements.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Email or account-based interest lists.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Clear "available now" vs. "coming soon" messaging.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 No final model needs to be chosen immediately. The first step can be discovery and a small pilot.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 5. Custom Product Development\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 If the relationship grows, RootRecord could support custom features such as:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A Doing Hawaii branded web experience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A mobile-friendly media library.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Creator profile and archive pages.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Partner landing pages.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local business or tourism content tools.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsor reporting or placement pages.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Suggested First Pilot\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 A practical first pilot could be:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Doing Hawaii Featured Partner Page\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord creates a clean partner page or in-app section that introduces Doing Hawaii and links to approved public content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Possible content:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Short Doing Hawaii introduction.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Creator story summary.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Selected public videos or playlists.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Selected photo/media links.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Links to Doing Hawaii website and social channels.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Optional support/donation link, if Doing Hawaii wants it included.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Kilauea Alerts Placement\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord adds a small, clearly labeled creator-media placement in Kilauea Alerts:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 "Featured local creator: Doing Hawaii"\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This should not interrupt emergency or official-source alert content. It should sit as an optional media/community section.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Review Period\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 After launch, both sides review:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Does the placement feel brand-safe?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Are users clicking through?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Is the content presented correctly?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Does Doing Hawaii want deeper integration?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Should a sponsor/supporter path be added?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Possible Benefits for Doing Hawaii\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Doing Hawaii could benefit from:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A more polished mobile-friendly content presentation.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Additional exposure to Kilauea-focused users.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Better organization of public content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A clearer path for supporters, sponsors, or future paid features.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Technical help without having to replace the existing creator identity.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A way to test a new digital experience before committing to a larger rebuild.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Possible Benefits for RootRecord\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord could benefit from:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Stronger local creator connection.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Richer Kilauea and Hawaii Island media context.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A more human layer alongside official-source alerts and data.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A partner story that helps show how RootRecord can support local creators and businesses.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A practical pilot for future media, sponsor, or local-business partnerships.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Important Boundaries\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 For clarity and trust, any partnership should respect these boundaries:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Doing Hawaii content should be presented as creator content or local perspective.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Official alerts, emergency guidance, weather, earthquakes, and government-source information should remain separate.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab RootRecord should not imply that creator content replaces official emergency sources.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Content ownership, permissions, revenue sharing, sponsor rules, and brand usage should be written down before public launch.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Any paid supporter or sponsorship model should be reviewed carefully before being promoted.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 These boundaries keep the partnership clean and help protect both sides.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Conversation Topics\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Recommended discussion questions:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 1.\tab What does Doing Hawaii most want to grow: audience, content organization, supporters, sponsors, app presence, or something else?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 2.\tab Which public content would Doing Hawaii feel comfortable featuring through RootRecord?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 3.\tab Should Kilauea-related creator content be part of the first pilot?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 4.\tab Would Doing Hawaii want a simple partner feature first, or a larger content hub plan?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 5.\tab Is the current donation/supporter model active, paused, or ready to be rebuilt?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 6.\tab What brand rules should RootRecord follow when presenting Doing Hawaii?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li620\fi-340\sa150 7.\tab What would make the first pilot feel successful?\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Recommended Next Step\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
